{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:962","content":{"id":962,"title":"模型设置","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了使用软件提供的 AI 功能，需要现在设置中配置使用的 AI 模型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在「大语言模型」Tab 下添加配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_78669327-3cc2-483f-8072-02d519109d72.webp","uuid":"81f01ce7-2a6a-4d0f-ad6f-a2e474d269d5","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_78669327-3cc2-483f-8072-02d519109d72.webp","width":720},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_aa0336e2-bd4f-4d4a-8ef3-356164d2ff22.webp","uuid":"0fc2c3b2-1b94-4aa3-b739-f51a0a4eac0c","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_aa0336e2-bd4f-4d4a-8ef3-356164d2ff22.webp","width":720}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着在该配置下添加模型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f2a644c3-127e-4cff-8173-efb3c725fb14.webp","uuid":"acf8ae0d-97c3-4e54-a49f-c68f1bc0c1db","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f2a644c3-127e-4cff-8173-efb3c725fb14.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在模型配置中存在一些选项："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"特性，表示模型支持的能力，比如是否支持思考，是否支持上传图片、音视频和文件"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"消息格式，目前适配了三种消息格式"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"OpenAI Chat completions，大部分模型都是使用的这个"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"OpenAI Responses，Codex 使用的这个"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Claude，Claude 模型使用这个"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置使用的模型"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e39b0a0-ec2e-4a3e-b820-6694871fcc30.webp","uuid":"03e0c84f-1f27-4d22-a1da-e0a6e16f010b","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e39b0a0-ec2e-4a3e-b820-6694871fcc30.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们在很多地方有使用到 AI，但是不同的地方对 AI 要求的能力是不一样的，比如对于总结对话标题的 AI，我们对其智力的要求不高，就可以选择一个简单成本低的模型，又比如，有的地方需要支持多模态的模型，那么我们必须配置一个多模态的模型才行，否则就没法使用"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"AI","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:758","type":"doc","id":758}},{"label":"模型设置","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:962","type":"doc","id":962}}],"prevPage":{"title":"AI","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:758","type":"doc","id":758}},"nextPage":{"title":"聊天管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:770","type":"doc","id":770}},"createTime":1777694674847,"updateTime":1777713422348,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777713422348}}